  "details": "In short, perhaps allow a script to allow box/sphere colliders collide with other people. As well a button to specifically have this feature on/off would be needed (and be OFF by default so new avatars can't mess with people cause people are mean). What I want is to perhaps have a ramp/platform for others to walk on. Maybe bring my own parkour with me, or my own platform to get away from people. Have my own little setting place. One could just make a world, and if I'm honest that would be somewhat easier, it would still be neat to be able to bring your own colliders with you. That and I'm trying to make a very cool rp boss avatar that brings a platform arena thing with and being able to collide with that would be epic.",
